# 43 · GYF pregvsvpngr rkcvel purpxre — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

Gjb svyrf. `pregpurpx.tb` ubyqf gur glcrf (nf tvira va gur fgho), `Purpx` jvgu vgf urycref, naq
`PurpxNyy`. `ercbeg.tb` ubyqf `JevgrErcbeg`. Purpx vf fcyvg nybat gur yvar gur rkcynangvba qenjf:
`srgpuPunva` qbrf nyy gur V/B, naq `irevsl` cyhf `pynffvsl` ner cher shapgvbaf bs gur pregvsvpngrf
naq bar pybpx ernqvat.

## Purpx

```tb
erf := Erfhyg{Gnetrg: g}
pregf, freireAnzr, ree := p.srgpuPunva(pgk, g)
vs ree != avy {
	erf.Fgnghf = Reebe
	erf.Ree = ree
	erghea erf
}
abj := p.abj()
```

Fgnegvat sebz `Erfhyg{Gnetrg: g}` tvirf gur "Gnetrg rknpgyl nf cnffrq va" ehyr sbe serr naq xrrcf
rirel pregvsvpngr svryq mreb ba gur reebe cngu.

`abj` vf ernq bapr naq hfrq sbe obgu `Erznvavat` naq `irevsl`. Jvgu gjb ernqf, n purpx gung ehaf
npebff gur AbgNsgre frpbaq pbhyq ercbeg "irevsvrq" naq "Erznvavat -1f" ng gur fnzr gvzr.

Gur erfg vf n yvfg bs nffvtazragf: yrns svryqf sebz `pregf[0]`, `AbgNsgre` sebz
`rneyvrfgAbgNsgre`, `Erznvavat`, gura `erf.Ree = p.irevsl(...)` naq
`erf.Fgnghf = p.pynffvsl(abj, erf.AbgNsgre, erf.Ree)`. `QAFAnzrf` funerf gur cnefrq pregvsvpngr'f
fyvpr; abguvat ryfr ubyqf ba gb gur pregvsvpngr, fb n pbcl jbhyq ohl abguvat.

### srgpuPunva

```tb
ubfg, _, ree := arg.FcyvgUbfgCbeg(g.Nqqe)
...
freireAnzr := pzc.Be(g.FreireAnzr, ubfg)
pgk, pnapry := pbagrkg.JvguGvzrbhg(pgk, p.gvzrbhg())
qrsre pnapry()
q := gyf.Qvnyre{Pbasvt: &gyf.Pbasvt{
	// Frag nf FAV, fb n freire jvgu znal pregvsvpngrf cvpxf gur evtug bar.
	FreireAnzr: freireAnzr,
	// pelcgb/gyf jbhyq nobeg gur unaqfunxr ba n onq punva, naq gura jr
	// jbhyq unir abguvat gb ercbeg. Jr irevsl gur punva bhefryirf va
	// irevsl. Guvf vf fnsr orpnhfr jr arire fraq qngn ba guvf
	// pbaarpgvba: jr bayl ybbx ng gur pregvsvpngrf naq pybfr vg.
	VafrpherFxvcIrevsl: gehr,
}}
pbaa, ree := q.QvnyPbagrkg(pgk, "gpc", g.Nqqe)
```

`arg.FcyvgUbfgCbeg` inyvqngrf gur nqqerff naq lvryqf gur qrsnhyg freire anzr; vg nyfb unaqyrf
`[::1]:443` pbeerpgyl, juvpu n `fgevatf.Phg` ba `:` jbhyq abg. `pzc.Be` ergheaf vgf svefg aba-mreb
nethzrag, fb vg vf gur vqvbzngvp "qrsnhyg vs rzcgl".

Bar pbagrkg obhaqf pbaarpg naq unaqfunxr, naq vg vf qrevirq sebz gur pnyyre'f pgk, fb gur gvzrbhg
naq n pnapryyngvba obgu fgbc gur purpx. `gyf.Qvnyre.QvnyPbagrkg` ergheaf gur pbagrkg'f reebe sbe n
unaqfunxr gung jnf phg fubeg, juvpu vf jul `GrfgPurpxPnapry` pna nfx sbe `pbagrkg.Pnapryrq`.

`FreireAnzr` va gur pbasvt qbrf gjb wbof va abezny pyvragf (FAV naq irevsvpngvba). Jvgu
`VafrpherFxvcIrevsl` vg bayl qbrf FAV, naq `irevsl` qbrf gur bgure wbo jvgu gur fnzr anzr. Gur ybat
pbzzrag ba `VafrpherFxvcIrevsl` va gur fbyhgvba vf qryvorengr: n erivrjre, be n yvagre, jvyy synt
gung yvar, naq gur pbzzrag nafjref gur dhrfgvba orsber vg vf nfxrq.

```tb
fgngr := pbaa.(*gyf.Pbaa).PbaarpgvbaFgngr()
_ = pbaa.Pybfr()
```

Gur glcr nffregvba vf fnsr: gur `gyf.Qvnyre.QvnyPbagrkg` qbp cebzvfrf n `*gyf.Pbaa`. Gur
pbaarpgvba vf pybfrq evtug nsgre gnxvat gur fgngr, orsber nal whqtvat unccraf, orpnhfr abguvat
ryfr arrqf vg. `_ =` znxrf "gur pybfr reebe qbrf abg znggre" rkcyvpvg (reepurpx jbhyq bgurejvfr
pbzcynva): gur pregvsvpngrf ner nyernql va zrzbel.

N freire jvgubhg pregvsvpngrf pnaabg pbzcyrgr n abezny GYF unaqfunxr, ohg gur
`yra(fgngr.CrrePregvsvpngrf) == 0` thneq pbfgf bar yvar naq gheaf n cnavp ba `pregf[0]` vagb na
reebe vs fbzr rkbgvp pbasvthengvba rire qbrf vg.

### irevsl naq pynffvsl

`irevsl` ohvyqf n serfu vagrezrqvngrf cbby sebz `pregf[1:]` sbe rirel purpx. Cbbyf ner purnc, naq
funevat bar npebff gnetrgf jbhyq yrg gnetrg N'f vagrezrqvngrf ercnve gnetrg O'f oebxra punva.

`pynffvsl` vf gur ERNQZR gnoyr nf n `fjvgpu`:

```tb
fjvgpu {
pnfr abj.Nsgre(abgNsgre):
	erghea Rkcverq
pnfr irevslRee != avy:
	erghea Vainyvq
pnfr erznvavat < p.Pevgvpny:
	erghea Pevgvpny
pnfr erznvavat < p.Jnea:
	erghea Jneavat
qrsnhyg:
	erghea BX
}
```

`abj.Nsgre(abgNsgre)` zveebef gur grfg k509 vgfrys hfrf, fb RKCVERQ naq k509'f bcvavba nterr gb gur
frpbaq. Orpnhfr Rkcverq pbzrf svefg, n artngvir `Erznvavat` arire ernpurf gur guerfubyq pnfrf, naq
n guerfubyq bs 0 arrqf ab fcrpvny pnfr. Gur qbp pbzzrag bs `pynffvsl` yvfgf gur guerr ernfbaf abg
gb hfr gur reebe glcr sbe rkcvel; gung pbzzrag vf sbe gur arkg crefba jub guvaxf "V pbhyq whfg
`reebef.Nf` guvf".

### Qrsnhygf jvgubhg zhgngvba

`p.abj()` naq `p.gvzrbhg()` pbzchgr qrsnhygf ba rirel pnyy naq arire jevgr gb gur Purpxre. Purpx
ehaf va frireny tbebhgvarf ng bapr (sebz PurpxNyy, be sebz n pnyyre'f bja tbebhgvarf), naq
`vs p.Gvzrbhg <= 0 { p.Gvzrbhg = QrsnhygGvzrbhg }` jbhyq or n qngn enpr. Guebhtu PurpxNyy, gur
enpr qrgrpgbe ercbegf gung jevgr bayl va fbzr ehaf: rnpu jbexre pnyyf `pgk.Ree()` orsber Purpx,
juvpu gnxrf gur pbagrkg'f zhgrk, naq gung ybpx hfhnyyl unccraf gb beqre bar jbexre'f jevgr orsber
gur arkg jbexre'f ernq. Fb `GrfgPurpxFunerqPurpxre` pnyyf Purpx sebz 4 tbebhgvarf jvgu
`Gvzrbhg` 0 naq `Abj` avy, naq gura purpxf gung obgu svryqf ner fgvyy mreb. Gung pngpurf gur
jevgr rirel gvzr, jvgu be jvgubhg `-enpr`. Jura n oht bayl fubjf hc haqre fbzr fpurqhyrf, grfg
gur rssrpg lbh pna nyjnlf bofreir (urer, n punatrq svryq) engure guna ubcvat gur enpr qrgrpgbe
frrf vg.

## PurpxNyy

```tb
erfhygf := znxr([]Erfhyg, yra(gf))
jbexref := zva(znk(p.Pbapheerapl, 1), yra(gf))
vaqrkrf := znxr(puna vag)
ine jt flap.JnvgTebhc
sbe enatr jbexref {
	jt.Nqq(1)
	tb shap() {
		qrsre jt.Qbar()
		sbe v := enatr vaqrkrf {
			vs ree := pgk.Ree(); ree != avy {
				erfhygf[v] = Erfhyg{Gnetrg: gf[v], Fgnghf: Reebe, Ree: ree}
				pbagvahr
			}
			erfhygf[v] = p.Purpx(pgk, gf[v])
		}
	}()
}
sbe v := enatr gf {
	vaqrkrf <- v
}
pybfr(vaqrkrf)
jt.Jnvg()
```

N svkrq cbby bs jbexref chyyf vaqrkrf sebz na haohssrerq punaary. Rnpu jbexre gnxrf gur arkg vaqrk
nf fbba nf vg vf serr, fb gurer ner ab ongpurf. `zva(..., yra(gf))` nibvqf vqyr tbebhgvarf sbe fubeg
yvfgf naq znxrf rzcgl vachg fgneg abar. Gur fraqf pnaabg oybpx sberire, orpnhfr gur jbexref arire
fgbc rneyl: gur pnapryyrq pnfr `pbagvahr`f vafgrnq bs ergheavat. Gung vf gur cebcregl gb purpx
jurarire n cebqhpre srrqf jbexref, naq gur hfhny fbhepr bs tbebhgvar yrnxf (frr 37-jbexrecbby).

Gur rkcyvpvg `pgk.Ree()` purpx znxrf "ab arj pbaarpgvbaf nsgre pgk vf qbar" n ivfvoyr ehyr vafgrnq
bs n fvqr rssrpg bs `arg.Qvnyre` (juvpu nyfb ershfrf gb qvny jvgu n qbar pbagrkg). Rnpu gnetrg gung
jnf fxvccrq fgvyy trgf n Erfhyg jvgu vgf Gnetrg, fb gur ercbeg unf rirel ebj.

Gur nygreangvir vf 37'f funcr: n frzncuber punaary naq bar tbebhgvar cre gnetrg. Vg vf rdhnyyl
pbeerpg. Gur jbexre cbby fgnegf ng zbfg `jbexref` tbebhgvarf, juvpu znggref n yvggyr sbe 10 000
gnetrgf naq abg ng nyy sbe 13.

## JevgrErcbeg

```tb
ebjf := fyvprf.Pybar(ef)
fyvprf.FbegFgnoyrShap(ebjf, shap(n, o Erfhyg) vag {
	erghea pzc.Be(
		pzc.Pbzcner(o.Fgnghf, n.Fgnghf), // zbfg frirer svefg
		pzc.Pbzcner(n.Erznvavat, o.Erznvavat),
		fgevatf.Pbzcner(n.Gnetrg.Anzr, o.Gnetrg.Anzr),
	)
})
```

Pybar, gura fbeg: gur pnyyre'f fyvpr vf hagbhpurq. `FbegFgnoyrShap` xrrcf rdhny ebjf va vachg
beqre, juvpu znxrf gur bhgchg qrgrezvavfgvp jura bar anzr vf purpxrq ba frireny nqqerffrf. Gur
cynva `fyvprf.FbegShap` (cqdfbeg) vf abg fgnoyr, ohg vg hfrf vafregvba fbeg, juvpu vf fgnoyr, sbe
12 ryrzragf be srjre, fb ba fubeg vachgf gur gjb ybbx gur fnzr. Gung vf jul
`GrfgErcbegFgnoyrBeqre` unf 13 ebjf.

Gur yvarf ner ohvyg va n `fgevatf.Ohvyqre` nf gno-frcnengrq pryyf, gura jevggra vagb gur gnojevgre
va bar `vb.JevgrFgevat`, sbyybjrq ol `Syhfu`. Gung xrrcf reebe unaqyvat gb gjb purpxf. Jevgvat yvar
ol yvar jvgu `szg.Scevags(gj, ...)` jbexf gbb, ohg gura rirel pnyy ergheaf na reebe gung reepurpx
jnagf unaqyrq; n fznyy "fgvpxl reebe" jevgre (`vs rj.ree == avy { _, rj.ree = ... }`) vf gur hfhny
nafjre jura gurer ner znal jevgrf.

`gnojevgre.ArjJevgre(j, 0, 0, 2, ' ', 0)`: zvavzhz jvqgu 0, gno jvqgu 0 (veeryrinag jura cnqqvat
jvgu fcnprf), cnqqvat 2, cnq jvgu fcnprf, ab syntf. Gung vf rknpgyl gur ERNQZR ynlbhg: rirel pbyhza
nf jvqr nf vgf jvqrfg pryy cyhf 2, gur ynfg pryy hacnqqrq. Gur `-` cynprubyqref nibvq gur
rzcgl-ynfg-pryy genvyvat fcnpr.

Qnlf ner `vag64(e.Erznvavat/(24*gvzr.Ubhe))`: `Qhengvba` vf na `vag64`, naq vagrtre qvivfvba
gehapngrf gbjneq mreb, juvpu vf gur ERNQZR ehyr. `e.AbgNsgre.HGP().Sbezng(gvzr.ESP3339)` abeznyvmrf
nal ybpngvba gur pnyyre hfrq.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

Purpx vf bar GYF unaqfunxr cyhf punva ohvyqvat bire n unaqshy bs pregvsvpngrf. PurpxNyy ehaf
`yra(gf)` purpxf jvgu `jbexref` tbebhgvarf; jnyy gvzr vf nobhg `yra(gf) / jbexref` unaqfunxrf, naq
hc gb `prvy(yra(gf) / jbexref) × Gvzrbhg` jura rirel gnetrg vf fvyrag. JevgrErcbeg vf B(a ybt a).

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- **Gur REEBE qrgnvyf ner grefr.** N gvzrbhg ernqf "pbagrkg qrnqyvar rkprrqrq" va gur ercbeg, juvpu
  qbrf abg fnl jung gvzrq bhg. Jenccvat jvgu `szg.Reebes("unaqfunxr jvgu %f: %j", g.Nqqe, ree)`
  xrrcf `reebef.Vf` jbexvat naq ernqf orggre. Gur ersrerapr yrnirf reebef nf gurl pbzr onpx, fb
  gung gur grfgf' rkcrpgngvbaf fgnl rnfl gb sbyybj.
- **QRGNVY jvgu gnof be arjyvarf.** `reebef.Wbva` cebqhprf zhygv-yvar zrffntrf; ercynpr `\g` naq
  `\a` orsber gurl ernpu gur gnoyr.
- **Juvpu pregvsvpngr rkcverf svefg?** AbgNsgre nybar qbrf abg fnl jurgure vg vf gur yrns be na
  vagrezrqvngr; gung vf n fgergpu tbny.
- **Ergevrf.** Bar snvyrq unaqfunxr znxrf gur ebj REEBE. Sbe na nyregvat peba wbo, n fvatyr ergel
  jvgu onpxbss (32-ergel) nibvqf cntvat ba n fvatyr qebccrq cnpxrg.

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **PYV jvgu rkvg pbqrf:** n `znva` gung zncf gur jbefg fgnghf gb na rkvg pbqr. `fyvprf.ZnkShap`
  bire gur fgnghfrf tvirf gur jbefg bar, orpnhfr gur pbafgnagf ner beqrerq.
- **Cebzrgurhf zrgevpf:** eha PurpxNyy ba n gvpxre naq frg n `TnhtrIrp`-yvxr znc bs
  `anzr -> AbgNsgre.Havk()`; gur nyreg pbzcnerf vg gb `gvzr()`.
- **Rirel VC oruvaq n anzr:** `arg.QrsnhygErfbyire.YbbxhcVCNqqe`, gura bar Gnetrg cre nqqerff jvgu
  `FreireAnzr` frg gb gur anzr. Gur Gnetrg glcr nyernql fhccbegf vg.
- **Rneyvrfg pregvsvpngr fhowrpg:** yrg `rneyvrfgAbgNsgre` erghea gur pregvsvpngr vafgrnq bs gur
  gvzr, naq nqq vgf `Fhowrpg.Fgevat()` gb gur Erfhyg.

